            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you are transporting products, supplies, or equipment for your work, short-term trailer rentals can be an effective solution. Hyundai Translead and Globe Trailers offer a wide range of trailers for you to choose from, so you can easily find the right equipment when you need it most. It's an easy way to ensure you have the tools you need for a fraction of the cost. Let's explore some of the key benefits of a <a href=\"/store/inventory?type=trailer&condition=rental\">short-term rental</a>.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-flexible",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Flexible for Your Schedule",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "flexible"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-flexible-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Do you have to transport items with a quick turnaround? Being under a time crunch is a stressful situation, especially if you don't have the equipment you need. A short-term trailer rental can be the convenient solution you need to get the job done on schedule. Short-term rentals are flexible and can help you transport a variety of cargo. From moving building materials to rubbish, we have a rental trailer that is perfect for the task at hand.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-financial",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Financial Benefits",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "financial"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-financial-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We understand how valuable it is to have the right equipment at the right time, but you don't have to spend a fortune transporting your products or services. By renting a trailer, you can get the transportation you need at a fraction of the cost of purchasing one. With a rental, you won't be responsible for the trailer's regular maintenance. You don't have to worry about finding parts or having a mechanic perform routine checkups. This can save you thousands over time, which you can invest back into your business. Whether you are working on a time-sensitive job or a multi-month project, short-term rentals can help you save money and help grow your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-there-when-needed",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "There When You Need It",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "there-when-needed"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-there-when-needed-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One of the biggest benefits of renting a trailer is its convenience. There is no need to own a trailer unless you need it on a daily or weekly basis. It can be expensive to find a permanent space to park a trailer, especially if you only need it for a short time. By renting a trailer, you can use it for as long as you need, return it, and then rent it again in the future if another project requires it.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-trailer-types",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Types of Trailers We Offer",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "trailer-types"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-trailer-types-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, we offer equipment from industry-leading brands Hyundai Translead and Globe Trailers. Each trailer type has its benefits, and we can help you decide which is best based on your project. Here is what sets them apart.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-trailer-types-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "brief",
                    "across": "3",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Dry Van Trailers",
                        "points": [],
                        "label": "HYUNDAI",
                        "intro": "Covered, so they can keep your items safe and secure during all kinds of weather and road conditions."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Flatbed Trailers",
                        "points": [],
                        "label": "HYUNDAI",
                        "intro": "If you have an oversized load, Hyundai flatbed trailers give you plenty of room to transport your items."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Refrigerated Trailers",
                        "points": [],
                        "label": "HYUNDAI",
                        "intro": "Temperature-controlled and enclosed, ensuring your items stay fresh and remain at their best quality."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Lowboy Trailers",
                        "points": [],
                        "label": "GLOBE",
                        "intro": "Lower to the ground, making it easier to place tall and heavy equipment onboard."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Dump-End Trailers",
                        "points": [],
                        "label": "GLOBE",
                        "intro": "Frequently used for hauling dirt, sand, soil, or transporting debris, with a unique unloading design that offers flexibility."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "marginBottom": 8
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-a-partner-you-can",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A Partner You Can Trust",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-a-partner-you-can-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State Trailers is more than a trailer rental company and dealership. We are a partner you can trust for all of your trailer needs. Providing excellent customer service is what drives us every day. We will help you select a trailer based on the job, ensure it is ready for when you pick it up, and answer any questions you may have about how to safely use it. Our team is here to make the experience as simple as possible for you.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-book-a-trailer-rental",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Book a Trailer Rental Today",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-book-a-trailer-rental-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State Trailers offers a selection of Hyundai dry vans, flatbeds, and refrigerated trailers as well as Globe dump-end and lowboys in addition to capacity spotters to ensure you can get the job done without any hassles. We are here to guide you and will make sure you have the equipment you need for your project. Our trailer booking process is simple and quick. To learn more about our trailer rentals, contact us today.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
